  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Icy_Phantom.png\" title=\"Icy Phantom\"><img alt=\"Icy Phantom\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"256\" src=\"/images/recovered/Icy_Phantom.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Icy_Phantom.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Icy Phantom</div></div></div>\n<p>These floating supernatural creatures cast balls of elemental damage, and are often found in the company of similarly themed elemental <a href=\"/wiki/Knight\" title=\"Knight\">Knights</a> and/or <a href=\"/wiki/Angel\" title=\"Angel\">Angels</a>.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Revenant\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Mage\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Burning Haunt\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Tainted_Grove\" title=\"Tainted Grove\">Tainted Grove</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Overlord's_Sepulcher\" title=\"Overlord's Sepulcher\">Overlord's Sepulcher</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Forest\" title=\"Dark Forest\">Dark Forest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Icy Phantom\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td>The <a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Path\" title=\"Embercore Path\">Embercore Path</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Phantom\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Phantom\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Toxic Haunt\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Searing Geist\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">Storerooms</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Royal Phantasm\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Pinnacle</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sinister Ebon Phantasm\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/HDoL\" title=\"HDoL\">HDoL</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[GG]Shade\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Embrace</a>GoS offs\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
